# =====================================================================
# Release V074 -- Scheduling pkg (1/n): diary Is_Dummy + synthetic entries
# =====================================================================
# Fact_Practitioner_Diaries gains Is_Dummy. The load now inserts SYNTHETIC diary
# entries for (practitioner, day) that have real non-cancelled patient appointments
# but no worked diary row -- span = first->last appointment, Is_Dummy=1. Sourced from
# Silver.Appointments so there's no dependency on the Gold appointments fact.
# Gives appointment-only days a worked-hours denominator for Chair Utilisation / Diary
# Fill. Validated on dev T100: 2,344 dummy days (avg 6.9h).
#
# Table is DROP/CREATE (rebuild) -> the next Orchestrate_Build repopulates it.
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V074__diary_is_dummy_synthetic.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Gold.Fact_Practitioner_Diaries.Table.sql
DEPLOY  Fabric\Gold.usp_Load_Fact_Practitioner_Diaries.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
